This product bundles "Specterm Mono" (src/assets/fonts), a modified version of
Monaspace Neon, Copyright (c) 2023 GitHub, licensed under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1 (see src/assets/fonts/OFL.txt; licenses/OFL.txt in the
installed app, next to this file). It is modified from the
original by the removal of TrueType hinting and by pinning its width and slant
axes, and is renamed because "Monaspace" is a Reserved Font Name.
